# Allowlist. The Containerfile only copies the Maven Wrapper, pom.xml and src/, so
# nothing else goes into the build context (no target/, .git/, IDE files or docs).
# If the Containerfile starts copying something new, allow it here too.
#
# Docker only reads .dockerignore. Podman and Buildah read .containerignore first and
# fall back to this file, so one file covers both.
*
!mvnw
!.mvn
!pom.xml
!src
